{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1039186-mortals-and-zombies","id":1039186,"title":"Mortals and Zombies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-27T18:29:34-08:00","id":1039186,"title":"Mortals and Zombies","content":"Hi everyone, I have a quick question and a possibly not so quick question.<br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure I've read somewhere about mortals summoning/controlling zombies. Could anyone point in the right direction, I would be most grateful.<br /> <br /> Second, is there anything like flesh-crafting but for mortals? Can't quite remember the spelling of the vampiric discipline so I won't butcher it here in an attempt, but something along the lines of that. I have a player that is interested in playing something along the lines of the Anita Blake book series and to some extent I agree that it would be an interesting character. Basically having the power to raise zombies via blood sacrifice (the older the corpse the higher the price); able to talk to and control zombies; eventually even able to make weird, monstrous creations from mashing bits together from various bodies (not exactly like that, but you you get the idea I'm sure). Does anything like that exist but for mortals? If so, where may one be able to find such readings?<br /> <br /> Thanks for the help!<br /> <br /> **Note: I am asking instead of stumbling through my books simply due to lack of free time. I did try a couple searches in the forum, but I have yet to find anything related. So, kind of being lazy but trying not to be at the same time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3268,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3268-krzyzstof","user":"Krzyzstof","date":". 01-27-2017, 09:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3268-krzyzstof","name":"Krzyzstof","avatar":"https://forum.